  "annotations_dropped": [
    {
      "annotation_id": "aa3e7bea549f4d0482c06dcbc66bbd7b_15",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "After taking the evidence and hearing both parties, the Tribunal by the impugned judgment, assessed compensation of Rs.90,700/-, attributed 50% contributory negligence against the petitioner, and awarded 50% of the compensation i.e., Rs.45,"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6fdb821410f140e0b0cc314de22d87cd_36",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "8. The prosecution papers on record goes to point out that there was an accident on 19.09.2011 at 3.15 p.m."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4b4c2a12d0cc41b7a7b25ee874c8e18f_37",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner along with his mother came to the spot of the NC: 2024:KHC:30741 accident in Auto Rickshaw at NH-17 and has alighted at the spot."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4cbf433aa6ef4456b5dfc4cb855f9288_38",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "They were intended to go to a mall situated on the other side of the road."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a2c3b772f27348bc8f2ce6e7c3f05cbc_39",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "At that time, Motor Cycle bearing Regn. No.KA-47-J-0900 hit against the petitioner causing him injuries."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "88d0da48dd024b0093e9b202e7fb3dc4_40",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Medical records show that the petitioner has suffered fracture of both bones of the left leg and fracture of left humorous."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ca9ef053b55d4b05839380987b5ebcad_41",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He was under hospitalization for 16 days."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1b46ed66fcab4e7fba6aac41f2095e6b_42",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "9. During the course of cross-examination, the mother of the petitioner has admitted that there was no fault on the part of the rider of the Motor Cycle."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "40f11fe44c4d4c9ea11aa5ad04df5e73_43",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Such evidence cannot be accepted even for logical purpose as it is the duty of the rider of the motor vehicle to take care of the road safety of the pedestrians who are crossing the road."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c38043bfd39d4b33a1deaec46fb15726_44",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The mahazar at Ex.P3 and complaint Ex."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "35df47546d964ef784e57ba122fc0b56_45",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "P2 clearly point out that the place of the accident is not the middle of the road and it was on the extreme left side of the road."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c509185b5bc94e5783ed2c1ad41f49fe_46",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Even taking into consideration that the petitioner has crossed the road, the attribution of 50%\ncontributory negligence cannot be supported with."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "400e6c1d21604048b79bc71b017142dd_47",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As a pedestrian, it is a duty of the mother to take care of the child."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "11822c39caa546a1a98eeb917032b056_48",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "For the negligence of the parents it is NC: 2024:KHC:30741 proper to attribute negligence to an extent of 25% on that of the Motor Cycle at 75 % and accordingly, the compensation has to be awarded."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c78d842e342542a28c69c9f77e093a61_49",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nMr Master Samar Ali vs Mr Abdul Salam on 2 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/187277059/\n3 10."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e3fa8dab488b485f894bf3912fafc667_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As regarding injuries and the treatment, the petitioner has relied on the evidence of PW-3, the treated doctor, who has spoken about the treatment as well as 15% whole body disability sustained by the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6f0ec75afbf44387a134bd04bfe2c905_51",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The medical evidence is persuasive and the whole body disability sustained by the petitioner could be taken as 15%."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "aff85af4cca34239abd0d79a435e5809_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Insofar as the assessment of loss of future income on account of disability, the Hon'ble Apex Court in the case of Mallikarjun (supra) at para 12 held that it will be a difficult task to make accurate assessment of compensation when the chi"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cfdaa96251ad4e82bf81a554d6034f8c_53",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hon'ble Apex Court held that it is desirable to award compensation of Rs.3,00,000/- in case of disability up to 30%, Rs.4,00,000/- up to 60%,\nRs.5,00,000/- up to 90% and Rs.6,00,000/- in case of 100%."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d630c613b8724d09890357b24d70def0_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In that case, Hon'ble Apex Court held that Rs.1,00,000/- shall be compensated in case the permanent disability is up to 10%."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3d2328b692d64200955f732ddbafc099_55",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Having regard to NC: 2024:KHC:30741 the 15% of the whole body disability, it is just and proper to assess Rs.1,50,000/- as a compensation towards disability suffered by the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2474c3b90a1f4faeb8b3656eb78a1ec7_56",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "11. The petitioner has suffered fractures, undergone pain and sufferings and loss of amenities and discomfort."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8b6e0a007b48457b901b62e15056596f_57",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, towards pain and sufferings Rs.50,000/- and towards loss of amenities and discomfort Rs.50,000/- is assessed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3c7fe90ca2514c9a8a89ce3d98690098_58",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Medical bills of Rs.39,700/- is to be reimbursed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9a6f787355a24bcda8cc79222f1c1e98_59",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Towards incidental expenses such as attendant charges, travel expenses and food and nourishment a sum of Rs.10,000/- is assessed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "57fcbcbfc10148c8a1b0f5a4bf858488_60",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner laid up minimum of three months for the nature of injuries and has to be attended by his mother, loss of income during the laid up of the child will be Rs.19,500/-(Rs.6,500/- x 3)."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "99851e1a46c34dfe8a6494d85a7b6dc1_61",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The child required future treatment and a sum of Rs.10,000/- is assessed towards future medical expenses."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7d26338d8ca84e26bc3f11826631b888_62",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "12. Therefore, the petitioner is entitled for compensation under the following heads:\nNC: 2024:KHC:30741 Particulars Amount"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0f29dec2cda54057b51bce1747855631_63",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "1. Pain and Sufferings Rs. 50,000/-\n"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "461372b606c4473386f45bdc8bbb730f_64",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "2. Medical Expenses Rs. 39,700/-\n3. Loss of income during laid Rs. 19,500/-\nup period 4. Loss of future income Rs. 1,50,000/-\n5. Loss of amenities and Rs. 50,000/-\ndiscomfort 6."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6700078621b84346ba3eefa5d29f385a_65",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Attendant charges, food Rs. 10,000/- & nourishment and transportation 7."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "862360088e744f46b6a4355a3208f654_67",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Thereby the petitioner is entitled to total compensation of Rs.3,29,200/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "97058e53903b4827b0ecee2a195bf1f4_68",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is just and proper compensation that the petitioner is entitled under the facts and circumstances of the case."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6c929c1f5806428c92aac979b57d5e5e_69",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "14. In view of the discussion supra, 25% of the compensation has to be deducted towards negligence of the part of the parents."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "363f46b7daf04d179846f6f99c3e4fb2_70",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Thereby the petitioner is entitled to 75% of the compensation, which comes to Rs.2,46,900/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "15146baec3e74b2e838d456bd9526197_72",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Liability on the part of the Insurance Company to indemnify the insured is not in dispute."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "82e245292a36490ba9b45c93be2deacc_73",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence,\nthe appeal merits consideration, in result, the following:"
    },
    {
